{
  "device": "pump-1",

  "_comment": [
    "The default device: one pump, readable over every protocol the board",
    "serves. Edit this file and the whole device changes; nothing is",
    "hardcoded in the image.",
    "",
    "Each tag says how it moves (sim), and where it appears on each",
    "protocol. A tag needs at least one protocol, and is either simulated",
    "or writable, never both.",
    "",
    "  sim: sine | ramp | toggle | counter | walk, with min, max, step,",
    "       period_s",
    "  modbus: holding | input | coil | discrete, plus scale. A register",
    "       carries value * scale, so 54.3 at scale 10 reads as 543.",
    "  opcua: the node name, reachable as ns=1;s=<device>.<node>",
    "  can: id, byte, len (1, 2 or 4), scale, period_s, order (big or",
    "       little; big is the default and what most CAN matrices use)",
    "",
    "A tag with \"signed\": true is two's complement on the wire, on both",
    "Modbus and CAN, so it can carry negative values. Without it a",
    "negative clamps to zero rather than wrapping into a huge number."
  ],

  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "temperature",
      "unit": "C",
      "type": "float",
      "sim": { "sine": { "min": 40, "max": 80, "period_s": 60 } },
      "modbus": { "input": 0, "scale": 10 },
      "opcua": "Temperature",
      "can": { "id": "0x100", "byte": 0, "len": 2, "scale": 10, "period_s": 0.1 }
    },
    {
      "name": "pressure",
      "unit": "bar",
      "type": "float",
      "sim": { "walk": { "min": 1.0, "max": 6.0, "step": 0.2, "period_s": 1 } },
      "modbus": { "input": 1, "scale": 100 },
      "opcua": "Pressure",
      "can": { "id": "0x100", "byte": 2, "len": 2, "scale": 100, "period_s": 0.1 }
    },
    {
      "name": "rpm",
      "unit": "rpm",
      "type": "int",
      "sim": { "ramp": { "min": 0, "max": 3000, "period_s": 30 } },
      "modbus": { "input": 2, "scale": 1 },
      "opcua": "Rpm",
      "can": { "id": "0x100", "byte": 4, "len": 2, "scale": 1, "period_s": 0.1 }
    },
    {
      "name": "ambient",
      "unit": "C",
      "type": "float",
      "signed": true,
      "sim": { "sine": { "min": -15, "max": 35, "period_s": 90 } },
      "modbus": { "input": 4, "scale": 10 },
      "opcua": "AmbientTemperature",
      "can": { "id": "0x101", "byte": 2, "len": 2, "scale": 10, "order": "little" }
    },
    {
      "name": "hours",
      "unit": "h",
      "type": "int",
      "sim": { "counter": { "min": 0, "max": 65000, "step": 1, "period_s": 1 } },
      "modbus": { "input": 3, "scale": 1 },
      "opcua": "RunHours"
    },
    {
      "name": "fault",
      "type": "bool",
      "sim": { "toggle": { "period_s": 120 } },
      "modbus": { "discrete": 0 },
      "opcua": "Fault",
      "can": { "id": "0x101", "byte": 0, "len": 1, "scale": 1, "period_s": 1 }
    },
    {
      "name": "setpoint",
      "unit": "C",
      "type": "float",
      "writable": true,
      "initial": 60,
      "modbus": { "holding": 0, "scale": 10 },
      "opcua": "Setpoint"
    },
    {
      "name": "run",
      "type": "bool",
      "writable": true,
      "initial": 1,
      "modbus": { "coil": 0 },
      "opcua": "Run"
    }
  ]
}
